      "placement": "traits",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The far dorocha has advantage on Intelligence (Arcana) checks made to know about shadow roads and shadow magic spells or items."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Under the Cloak of Night",
      "category": "passive",
      "placement": "traits",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "While in dim light or darkness, the far dorocha's AC includes its Charisma modifier, and it has advantage on saving throws."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Innate Spellcasting",
      "category": "passive",
      "placement": "traits",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The far dorocha's innate spellcasting ability is Charisma (spell save DC 15). It can innately cast the following spells, requiring no material components.",
        "At will: disguise self, thaumaturgy",
        "3/day each: command, phantom steed",
        "1/day each: compulsion, darkness"
